Thus they added handling for nested struct arrays where elements are not ByReference (i.e., inline struct arrays). This addresses bug with nested struct array read/write. Also modifications to read/write? The diff only in readField method. It adds support for non-ByReference struct arrays.

Commit message matches. Also bug fix indicator: added null handling, newInstance, useMemory, read, etc.

