```

So originally, docValues assignment only inside the if block when globalDocValues is MultiSortedDocValues. And also they used globalDocValues variable. Now they check ordinalMap not null, set toGlobal accordingly, then always set docValues. This matches commit message about setting and resetting string doc-values while exporting documents. The bug likely was that docValues wasn't set when ordinalMap null, causing stale docValues. The change ensures resetting docValues each time for each segment. Also uses ordinalMap check instead of instanceof globalDocValues. This seems like bug fix.

