CommitMessage: Fixed a bug where '.' was returned when the field was empty in the case where the editor has been configured for files only (rather than directories)

git-svn-id: https://svn.cms.waikato.ac.nz/svn/weka/trunk@13132 e0a1b77d-ad91-4216-81b1-defd5f83fa92

