CommitMessage: Fixed a bug (due to changes in BatchPredictor) that caused predictions for AUC, AUPRC to always be retained regardless of the user-specified fraction

git-svn-id: https://svn.cms.waikato.ac.nz/svn/weka/trunk@12342 e0a1b77d-ad91-4216-81b1-defd5f83fa92

